OL,3,GNEWSASchool holiday fines climb despite
OL,4,Agrowing backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of fines issued to families
OL,7,Facross the West Midlands for taking
OL,8,Fchildren out of school during term time
OL,9,Fhas almost doubled in five years,
OL,10,Faccording to BBC analysis.
OL,12,FCouncils in the region issued 59,440
OL,13,FFixed Penalty Notices (FPNs) for
OL,14,Funauthorised holiday absences in the
OL,15,F2024-25 financial year, compared with
OL,16,F30,143 in 2018-19.
OL,18,FBBC analysis found every local
OL,19,Fauthority in the West Midlands except
OL,20,FHerefordshire recorded an increase in
OL,21,Ffines during the period.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
